neiextend.help.tab=Hide a tab
neiextend.help.tab_text=Open recipes (R) or uses (U) of any item. On the right of NEI's window there is a small bar: the crossed eye hides the tab shown, for every item. Or flip its switch on the Tabs page here. Right click a tab in the list to open it with all its recipes - even a hidden one; Escape comes back here.
neiextend.help.recipe=Hide a recipe
neiextend.help.recipe_text=Press the crosshair on that bar, then click the recipes you don't want: each one goes at once. Right click or press the crosshair again to stop. A tab left without recipes goes away too.
neiextend.help.restore=Bring it back
neiextend.help.restore_text=Right after hiding, "Undo" under NEI's window takes it back. Later on, everything hidden is listed here: flip a tab's switch or press "Show" next to a recipe.
neiextend.help.about=Key and files
neiextend.help.about_text=This window: the gear on NEI's bar, or the key in Controls (now: %s). It all stays in config/neiextend.json on your computer: the mod is client-only and works on any server.

